Uncommitted, **built but not deployed and not rig-verified — nothing measured this session**. The proto_gen bump requires the re-mkfs that `MXFS_FORCE_PREP=1 ./run.sh 32 caw prep_cluster` performs; a gen-2 volume will refuse gen-3 code.

Banked in ccmemory as `ccloop-c7ee71c6-sess87-incarnation-landing-COMPLETE-BUILT-not-deployed`, and the ledger's `next` now points at the rig cycle.

